      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Part 3 of 3: Record the decision and notify the employee\n**Employee Request and Approval Router**\n\n1. Is Approved?: checks which button the approver clicked on the email from part 2, Approve or Decline, and splits the workflow into two paths based on that answer.\n\n2. Mark Approved: if the request was approved, this updates that exact same row in the Data Table, setting its status to Approved and recording the time of the decision.\n\n3. Notify Employee - Approved: emails the employee to let them know their request was approved and that the right team will follow up.\n\n4. Mark Rejected: if the request was declined instead, this updates the same row with status Rejected and the time of the decision.\n\n5. Notify Employee - Declined: emails the employee to let them know their request was not approved this time.\n\nImport this after part 2 and connect Request Approval into Is Approved?.",
        "width": 760,
        "height": 320
      }
    }
